tweets.text:
What happens when you let an AI agent run the company?

@jayantkrish is finding out. His agent is CEO of a business, deciding what the product is, which services to buy and how to market it. He's not sure it'll work, but it's making the same kinds of calls he would.

"My conclusions thus far have been I'm impressed."

